ind":"update","title":"v0.1.2 Demo Patch","summary":"Patch notes can also be read here: https://5yearsnow.com/games/5YN-OS/patch/v0.1.2-demoGeneralAdded gamepad controls for the desktop and Doomlike, including a virtual cursor, window controls, scrolling, and text entry.Added remappable controller buttons, cursor speed, and deadzone settings. Controller support has been tested on Steam Deck and a Logitech controller and should work across most controllers.Added a first-boot notification pointing new players toward Definitely Normal, Darknet, and D","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T10:35:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656380713","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:17:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4695620-1842846814453937","game_id":"steam-4695620","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo is now available!","summary":"The Steam Demo for 5YN-OS is now available! If you have any questions feel free to reach out on the 5 Years Now Discord server: https://discord.com/invite/URsQvAdYRN For FantasyLang documentation check it out on the official website here: https://5yn-os.com/fantasylang If you encounter any issues, bugs, or crashes please let us know either in the #bug-reports Discord channel or email support@5yearsnow.com.Enjoy!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T19:30:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814453937","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:17:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4695620-1842846814452668","game_id":"steam-4695620","kind":"update","title":"v0.1.1 Demo Launch Day Patch","summary":"Newly UnlockedUpdates app is now accessible in the demo.Theme Builder app is now accessible in the demo.GeneralAllow manual game window resizing, capped at a minimum of 1200x800 resolution. (Suggested by I'm an issue)Logs app now displays a desktop notification when you press export instead of a text message within the app window.Bug FixesFixed Logs app export not creating the exported log file. (Reported by I'm an issue)Fixed Scratch Scroll app text not being hightlightable/selectable.Fixed Scr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T09:50:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814452668","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:17:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4695620-1842846814441663","game_id":"steam-4695620","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Log 10 - Build a Desktop Widget in FantasyLang","summary":"Three lines get a chromeless window running on your desktop. A dozen more make it visible. About a hundred make it a registered widget that draws, remembers where you put it, has a right-click menu, and can be published to the Workshop.Read Dev Log 10 in full here: https://5yn-os.com/blog/blog-post-01-09-2026","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T22:32:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814441663","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:17:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4695620-1842212951305018","game_id":"steam-4695620","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Log 9 - Nine Games Inside an Operating System, and You Can Read Their Source","summary":"A roguelike, an idle guild sim, an autobattler, tower defence, poker, a logic simulator, a desktop pet, noughts and crosses, and a Doom-like. Eight of the nine are written in the operating system's own language, and they are sitting in your file system right now. Read the full blog post here: https://5yn-os.com/blog/blog-post-28-08-2026","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-29T05:40:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951305018","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:17:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4695620-1842212951296151","game_id":"steam-4695620","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Log 8 - Make It Yours: Themes, Widgets and Layouts","summary":"Read the full dev blog here: https://5yn-os.com/blog/blog-post-25-08-2026","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T08:18:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951296151","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:17:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4695620-1841579228668681","game_id":"steam-4695620","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Log 7 - Killing the Start Menu: Designing the Spider Web","summary":"A Start menu is a list pretending to be a place. I wanted an actual place - so the launcher in 5YN-OS is a web you navigate outward from a centre, and the window manager underneath it had to be good enough to justify the decision.Read the full blog post here: https://5yn-os.com/blog/blog-post-21-08-2026","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T13:00:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228668681","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:17:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4695620-1840944183788801","game_id":"steam-4695620","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Log 6 - Learning to Program by Being Handed a Computer","summary":"Dev Academy does not give you exercises. It gives you a machine, a reason to use it, and fifty-three steps that add up to one working full-stack project - an app, a website, a server, a database, and a commit history. Read the full blog post here: https://5yn-os.com/blog/blog-post-18-08-2026","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-18T13:30:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183788801","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:17:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4695620-1840944183777728","game_id":"steam-4695620","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Log 5 - Definitely Normal: The Puzzle Board Is Your Desktop","summary":"The 5th blog post does a deep dive into the puzzle game https://5yn-os.com/blog/blog-post-14-08-2026","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-13T19:30:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183777728","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:17:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4695620-1840310314352350","game_id":"steam-4695620","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Log 4 - 120 Commands, and None of Them Are Props","summary":"The 4th blog post does a deep dive into the in-game Terminal https://5yn-os.com/blog/blog-post-11-08-2026","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-10T19:00:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314352350","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:17:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4695620-1840310314347900","game_id":"steam-4695620","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Log 3 - I Built a Programming Language Inside a Game - Then Let It Escape","summary":"Developer log 3 discusses the FantasyLang programming language and it's in-game implementation and standalone implementation that lives outside of the game. You can read the blog here: https://5yn-os.com/blog/blog-post-07-08-2026","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-08T17:30:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314347900","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:17:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4695620-1839676055897946","game_id":"steam-4695620","kind":"announcement","title":"Developer Log 2 - The Darknet is not a hacking simulator","summary":"You can read about the in-game Darknet feature in the second developer log here: https://5yn-os.com/blog/blog-post-04-08-2026","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-04T17:00:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055897946","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:17:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4695620-1839676055886247","game_id":"steam-4695620","kind":"announcement","title":"Developer Log 1 - What is 5YN-OS?","summary":"You can check out the first developer log here: https://5yn-os.com/blog/blog-post-26-07-2026","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-30T19:30:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055886247","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:17:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4695620":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:37:57Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:37:56Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4695620":"2026-10-26T13:37:57Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4695620":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:37:56Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:37:56Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:37:56Z"},"5156750":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:37:57Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:37:57Z","status":"